```plantuml
@startuml
!define componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentStyle $componentStyle
' Component Diagram for MySQL Data Migration Tool

package "Core" {
  [conf.go] as Conf
  [dao.go] as DAO
}

[full_data_migration.go] as FullMigration
[incremental_data_migration.go] as IncrementalMigration
[README.md] as Documentation
[static/img/architecture.jpg] as ArchitectureImage

FullMigration --> Conf : Uses Configuration
FullMigration --> DAO : Uses Database Access
IncrementalMigration --> Conf : Uses Configuration
IncrementalMigration --> DAO : Uses Database Access
Documentation -- ArchitectureImage : Includes
Documentation -- FullMigration : Describes
Documentation -- IncrementalMigration : Describes

FullMigration --|> IncrementalMigration : Precedes
@enduml
